<title>BELGIUM: Belgian money market supply boosted in week.</title>
<headline>Belgian money market supply boosted in week.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank said it added liquidity to the money market in the week to May 5 to offset a rise in notes in circulation.</p>
<p>(figures from the weekly statement in bln francs) -</p>
<p> Advances against pledged security  17.33 (+  0.44)</p>
<p> Commercial bills			  2.52 (unchanged)</p>
<p> Securities portfolio		   23.81 (unchanged)</p>
<p> Money market interventions*	 110.73 (+ 11.76)</p>
<p> Bank notes in circulation	   468.81 (+  9.88)</p>
<p>* comprises repurchase agreements and interbank loans.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
